    "text": "2 hours ago\nNEWARK, N.J. — Authorities are asking for the public’s assistance in locating a Newark teenager who was reported missing this week. According to officials, Maria was last seen at approximately 2:50 p.m. near South Street and Orchard Street in Newark. She is described as Hispanic, standing 5 feet 2 inches tall and weighing about 160 pounds. She has black hair and brown eyes.\nRead full article",
